{'symbol': 'SRE', 'date': '2022-07-14 06:50:00', 'title': 'SEMPRA ANNOUNCES PARTNERSHIP FRAMEWORK WITH CONOCOPHILLIPS', 'text': 'PROVIDES COMPREHENSIVE FRAMEWORK TO DEVELOP PORT ARTHUR LNG ADVANCES BROAD COLLABORATION ON THE DEVELOPMENT OF ECA LNG PHASE 2 PROVIDES FOR COOPERATION ON ASSOCIATED CARBON SEQUESTRATION AND LOW-CARBON HYDROGEN OPPORTUNITIES SAN DIEGO , JULY 14, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0SEMPRA\xa0(NYSE: SRE) (BMV: SRE) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS SUBSIDIARY, SEMPRA INFRASTRUCTURE, AND CONOCOPHILLIPS (NYSE: COP) HAVE ENTERED INTO A HEADS OF AGREEMENT (HOA) TO DEVELOP SEMPRA INFRASTRUCTURE\'S PORT ARTHUR LNG PROJECT AND JOINTLY PARTICIPATE IN OTHER RELATED ENERGY INFRASTRUCTURE IN SOUTHEAST TEXAS AND THE PACIFIC COAST OF MEXICO. "AT SEMPRA, WE BELIEVE BOLD NEW PARTNERSHIPS WILL BE CENTRAL TO SOLVING THE WORLD\'S ENERGY SECURITY AND DECARBONIZATION CHALLENGES," SAID JEFFREY W.'}